        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DP2575, 10 Inch Traditional Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHigh quality solid brass door pull that is not to plain, but not to fancy. It is one of our best selling door pulls. Available in your choice of 7 different finish colors: oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, antique nickel, polished chrome, antique brass, and polished brass. Manufactured by Deltana the nations most complete provider of all of your solid brass door hardware needs. The Solid Brass 10\" Door Pull has a 1\" diameter with a 2-15/16\" projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DP2575-Specifications.gif?v=1704354549\" width=\"432\" height=\"135\" border=\"0\" atl=\"10 Inch C-Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-heavy-duty-pull-plate-3-1-2-x-20-with-11-inch-handle-deltana-pph3520-dp2575\"><b>Plate Mounted 10 Inch Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-8-inch-door-pull-deltana-dp2574\"><b>8 Inch Door Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-door-pull-deltana-dp675\"><b>6 Inch Door Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Deltana DP2575 Traditional 10 Inch Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Hole Spacing: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter at Mount: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Screws: 1/4\"-24 x 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with thru-bolt mounting screws. You can use <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-decorative-screw-cover-deltana-scd100\"><b>Decorative Screw Covers</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/sleek-screw-cover-deltana-scf100\"><b>Flat Top Screw Covers</b></a> to hide the screw heads on the inside of the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
